  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> be three planes, then the distance of the line of intersection of planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> from the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
